  "description": "Five Nights at Freddy's 2 Minecraft Fully Playable Map",
  "body": "## **This is the full playable Five Nights at Freddy's 2 Map Experience inside of Minecraft!**\nThis package includes a full non-offical playable recreation of Five Nights at Freddy's 2 with 6 nights.\n\nThis map has _5 Main Nights_, as well as _The 1 Bonus Night_ to play!\nThere are also _12 Achievements and 12 Challenges to try_!\n\n## Map Credits:\n- [Clouser](https://www.youtube.com/c/C1OUS3R): Coding/Building/Resources/Sfx\n- [NoteBlockMatt](https://www.youtube.com/@NoteBlockMatt): Music/Sfx\n- [KaiCoyote](https://www.pixilart.com/kaicoyote): Resources\n\n![FNAF 2 Minecraft Logo](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6755fe9cbccca8a36fd74de0d4563319e1d3b712.png)",
